polynomial-set: <k>[\left\{p\in C^2(K)\cap C^{k-2}(b)\middle|p|_T\in{{poly[k]}}(T),\ T\in\mathcal{T}^{\mathrm{AA}},\ p\in C^{k-1}(c_i),\ [\partial_n^jp]_e=0,\ e\in\mathcal{E}^{\mathrm{A}},\ 0\leq j\leq k-2\right\}@def@\mathcal{T}^{\mathrm{AA}}@the double Alfeld split@@def@b@the centroid of the reference triangle@@def@c_i@the centroid of the ith triangle of the first Alfeld split@@def@\mathcal{E}^{\mathrm{A}}@the interior edges of the first Alfeld split@]
